    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d272">

                <pb facs="0291" n="279" xml:id="pg279"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control (Bulgaria)/8–745:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States Representative in Bulgaria</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Barnes</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sofia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-07T19:00:00+02:00">August 7, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 7—4:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>428. Day after issuance Potsdam declaration local newspaper <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Izgrev</hi> published article containing among other
                    things suggestion that ACC was about to become really tripartite. Biryusov has
                    just had editor in to tell him that such “stupid and unpatriotic”
                    interpretations will not be tolerated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Barnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
